Notice of modification (GNU GPL v3 section 5(a), incorporated by LGPL v3)
----------------------------------------------------------------------------

This program is a modified version of Debugify 1.21.1+1.0. It was modified
on 26 September 2026 as follows:

  * Ported the mod loader from Fabric to NeoForge 21.1: fabric-loom ->
    net.neoforged.moddev, fabric.mod.json -> META-INF/neoforge.mods.toml,
    debugify.accesswidener -> META-INF/accesstransformer.cfg, and the
    mixin refmaps were dropped because NeoForge runs on official Mojang
    mappings.
  * Replaced the Fabric entrypoints (ModInitializer, ClientModInitializer,
    the modmenu entrypoint) with an @Mod class, an FMLClientSetupEvent
    listener and NeoForge's IConfigScreenFactory extension point.
  * Replaced FabricLoader and mod-container API calls with FML's ModList,
    FMLPaths and FMLEnvironment, null safe for the early mixin plugin.
  * Replaced Debugify's "debugify" entrypoint mechanism for DebugifyApi
    with an explicit Debugify.registerApi(modId, api) registry, because
    NeoForge has no equivalent of Fabric's entrypoint containers.
  * Repointed the mixin members whose targets NeoForge's patched
    Minecraft classes moved or renamed, notably MC-121706, MC-577,
    MC-176559 and MC-93384. See PORTING-NOTES.md.
  * Renamed the mod from debugify to neobugify, including its display
    name, jar name, icon, configuration file names, translation namespace
    and option key, and set the license to LGPL-3.0-only.
  * Removed the Fabric-only ModMenu integration.

No copyright, licence or warranty notices from the original work were
removed. Debugify's own acknowledgements are retained in
META-INF/neoforge.mods.toml.


